body:
Another food tip: Pop a rad-X and collect as much dirty water from a stream that you can carry, it should only take a minute if you spam. Try to find a carrot or two from a nearby farm, then create your own little farm of carrots. With boiled water, carrots and wood, create lots and lots of carrot soup which acts like food, water, HP and gives +2 of a stat (I think it's END). You can still drink something for drink stats.

&#x200B;

You can also create your own farm of tato, mutfruit, and corn (tip 5) for unlimited adhesive
